  "description": "Back at school after a year. On her first day back, she thought it would be fun, but a miraculous turn of events landed her in the same class as her younger sibling. Then, a stranger caught her embarrassingly...! And why did that man have to be Seo Jin-Young?! Why am I getting involved with Jin-Young, whom I haven't spoken to all school year, now?\n\nDa-Jung's school life is going haywire... Please, let her graduate safely!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
